==Esperanto==

===Etymology===
Esperanto ''[[ki-]]'' (interrogative and relative [[:Category:Esperanto correlatives|correlative]] prefix) + ''[[-u]]'' (correlative suffix of individuals)

===Pronoun===
'''kiu''' (''plural'' '''[[kiuj]]''', ''accusative singular'' '''[[kiun]]''', ''accusative plural'' '''[[kiujn]]''')
# [[who]] (the interrogative correlative of individuals)

===Conjunction===
'''kiu''' (''plural'' '''[[kiuj]]''', ''accusative singular'' '''[[kiun]]''', ''accusative plural'' '''[[kiujn]]''')
# [[which]], [[what]] (the relative correlative of individuals)

===Usage notes===
Like other interrogative and relative correlatives, '''kiu''' can be combined with ''[[ajn]]'', the adverbial particle of generality. '''''Kiu''' ajn'' thus means ''[[whoever]]''.

